{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Google Maps 已更新，改善對 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 螢幕的支援，應用現在會填滿這款摺疊 iPhone 的內外螢幕，不再在邊緣留下未使用空間。更新版本為 26.44.4，已在 App Store 上架。Google 的發佈說明未有提及針對 Duo 的改動，但更新後的支援顯而易見。</p><h2>內外螢幕填滿顯示</h2><p>新版地圖延伸至內螢幕，搜尋欄位於左上角，Explore、You 及 Contribute 分頁置於左側面板，地圖控制項則在右側。</p><p></p><p>之前的版本 26.43.1 僅局部適配裝置，內外螢幕右側仍有一條垂直黑色邊框，即圓形狀態欄所在位置。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h2>多款應用陸續適配</h2><p>Google Maps 跟隨越來越多應用適配 Apple 的摺疊 iPhone。本週早些時候，Zoom 及多款 Microsoft 應用獲得 Duo 優化，包括 Word、PowerPoint、Excel 和 OneNote。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"與 iPhone Duo 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8343f57d31e0f5f5258418b3058c0dcdb3e0f730589a84454c22a7f4e0416530/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F05ddc72b82ba42f233ef3beca843295e\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:06:32.174486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":392,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:39:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:44.725938+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:59:17.733328+00:00","content_hash":"b2a407b742173d3fb8f740fb90f6f3b0683f23dc9cd95a2330aca8c8082cc9de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}